; Manual Test: read-line
; This test requires stdin input and cannot be automated.
; Run manually: build/boot/zyl-self tests/manual/read-line.zyl -o t.bin && echo 'hello world' | ./t.bin
; Currently fails to link (undefined reference to `_ZYL_main`): the file
; is a bare top-level `let` with no `(defn main ...)`, and a top-level
; expression does not become an implicit main.
; Expected: got: hello world

(let input (read-line)
  (print "got: " input))
